{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1391742-cainites-like-devil-tiger","id":1391742,"title":"Cainites like Devil-Tiger?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-26T12:01:42-07:00","id":1391742,"title":"Cainites like Devil-Tiger?","content":"So Devil-Tigers is a Dharma (equal to Path of Enlightenment in VtM) of Wan Gui, the Kindred of the East. It is also my favorite one. It thinks Wan Gui are demons appointed by Heaven, having duties to punish the unrighteous beings. They use wicked powers to fight wicked creatures and devote themselves to the P\u2019o (equal to Beast of VtM). They look like infernalist, but they\u2019re not indeed<br /> <br /> So have you created a Cainite like this? A good Sabbat or anti-hero \u201cevil\u201d vampires who use infernal powers to do righteous things? They may have rather high virtue indeed","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-26T13:06:44-07:00","id":1391758,"title":"","content":"Look at path of night","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-26T14:54:45-07:00","id":1391784,"title":"","content":"Yeah, it\u2019s something some Catholic Lasombra have also dabbled in. It eventually informed the Sabbat\u2019s unique theology, in which they\u2019re the good guys fighting for redemption in the eyes of Caine. But, also influenced by the Cainite Heresy, the Sabbat reject God\u2019s authority and focus on Caine as their messiah.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/352-black-flag","name":"Black Flag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar352_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-26T16:06:24-07:00","id":1391803,"title":"","content":"the closest thing to Devil Tigers are the Martyrs,<br /> they're Sabbat on the path of Redemption,<br /> they believe they are monsters cursed by God with the duty to punish Sinners<br /> <br /> there's another one called Path of Righteous Night, which is the legacy of the Road of Night,<br /> it's pretty much the same as Redemption, just more niche (cause lasombra love their niche paths)<br /> <br /> however, to get a perfect copy of Devil Tiger dharma, you need to mix in a bit of path Lilith (pain), Night (evil) and Redemption (punishing sinners)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":10998,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","user":"Pleiades","date":". 05-26-2020, 07:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-26T17:00:44-07:00","id":1391808,"title":"","content":"An Assamite/Banu Haqim that only accepts contracts for the depraved, criminal, or otherwise usually classified as &quot;bad&quot; people fits the profile quite well. Such a character is more or less Dexter Morgan with fangs.... right down to the fascination with blood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-27T07:31:17-07:00","id":1391924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rock113</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1391742-cainites-like-devil-tiger#post1391742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So Devil-Tigers is a Dharma (equal to Path of Enlightenment in VtM) of Wan Gui, the Kindred of the East. It is also my favorite one. It thinks Wan Gui are demons appointed by Heaven, having duties to punish the unrighteous beings. They use wicked powers to fight wicked creatures and devote themselves to the P\u2019o (equal to Beast of VtM). They look like infernalist, but they\u2019re not indeed<br /> <br /> So have you created a Cainite like this? A good Sabbat or anti-hero \u201cevil\u201d vampires who use infernal powers to do righteous things? They may have rather high virtue indeed</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly I was thinking of incorporating in my headcanon the idea of Wan Gui Missionaries that help indoctrinate willing Cainites into approximation Roads based on Dharmas. They would be rare since they would be hated by Kindred and Wan Gui general populace, but they could serve an interesting niche purpose.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-27T07:41:30-07:00","id":1391928,"title":"","content":"Assamites, they are even called Silent Tigres in the East.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24202-justycar","name":"Justycar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24202_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"320"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-15T21:57:07-07:00","id":1413906,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1391742-cainites-like-devil-tiger?p=1391803#post1391803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">the closest thing to Devil Tigers are the Martyrs,<br /> they're Sabbat on the path of Redemption,<br /> they believe they are monsters cursed by God with the duty to punish Sinners<br /> <br /> there's another one called Path of Righteous Night, which is the legacy of the Road of Night,<br /> it's pretty much the same as Redemption, just more niche (cause lasombra love their niche paths)<br /> <br /> however, to get a perfect copy of Devil Tiger dharma, you need to mix in a bit of path Lilith (pain), Night (evil) and Redemption (punishing sinners)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Pardon the ignorance, but the Path of Redemption is kind of a modern version of DAV's Road of Heaven introduced in Chaining the Beast or am i mistaken on that? Got that impression from a quick read on the <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Path_of_Redemption\" target=\"_blank\">wiki</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-16T03:22:59-07:00","id":1413930,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1391742-cainites-like-devil-tiger?p=1413906#post1413906\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Pardon the ignorance, but the Path of Redemption is kind of a modern version of DAV's Road of Heaven introduced in Chaining the Beast or am i mistaken on that? Got that impression from a quick read on the <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Path_of_Redemption\" target=\"_blank\">wiki</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div>yes, though as far as I know, Road of Heaven see themselves as blessed (sometimes as quasi-angels) whereas path of Redemption see themselves as monsters, accept their damnation and are expected to explore sin<br /> <br /> on that respect, the kuei-jin are closer to the Redemption perspective than the Heaven one","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-16T05:35:15-07:00","id":1413945,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1391742-cainites-like-devil-tiger?p=1413930#post1413930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> yes, though as far as I know, Road of Heaven see themselves as blessed (sometimes as quasi-angels) whereas path of Redemption see themselves as monsters, accept their damnation and are expected to explore sin<br /> <br /> on that respect, the kuei-jin are closer to the Redemption perspective than the Heaven one</div> </div> </div> </div>Redemption sounds like a remake/retcon of the Nocturnal Redemption path from Montreal by Night than &quot;vanilla&quot; Road of Heaven, i guess, a perspective more in tune with the Cainite Heresy possibly. Heaven itself might be seen as closer to the Resplendent Crane dharma, possibly.<br /> <br /> (Incidentally, some wordcount spent on the Cainite Heresy, gnosticism and how it might tie up with the paths of Redemption, Cathari and the Sabbat as a whole could be an interesting read)<br /> <br /> Also, Song of Shadow is a dharma that sounds more in tune with the Oblivion discipline than anything else in the game. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 09-16-2020, 09:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-16T07:11:54-07:00","id":1413963,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1391742-cainites-like-devil-tiger?p=1413930#post1413930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> yes, though as far as I know, Road of Heaven see themselves as blessed (sometimes as quasi-angels) whereas path of Redemption see themselves as monsters, accept their damnation and are expected to explore sin<br /> <br /> on that respect, the kuei-jin are closer to the Redemption perspective than the Heaven one</div> </div> </div> </div>The Path of Divinity puts kindred above mortals in God's plan, but the Paths of Penitence and Tears teach that kindred are <i>inferior</i> to mortals. I'm not sure if the fourth path, of Retribution, specifies whether kindred are better or worse than mortals; I think their role, as punishers of sinners, is just different.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3523-spencer-from-the-hills","name":"Spencer from The Hills","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"546"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-16T12:27:04-07:00","id":1414012,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1391742-cainites-like-devil-tiger?p=1413945#post1413945\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> (Incidentally, some wordcount spent on the Cainite Heresy, gnosticism and how it might tie up with the paths of Redemption, Cathari and the Sabbat as a whole could be an interesting read)</div> </div> </div> </div>iirc, the guide to the Black Hand mentioned Cathari having started as a heretical way of the cainite heresy (a heresy of a heresy, since they worship opposite Gods),<br /> if the cathari are still alive (which I highly doubt), they'd probably be terrorizing or hunting down the church of caine (since that's all they can do nowadays)<br /> <br /> Redemption probably doesn't care about gnosticism, and definitely doesn't care about noddism (to them, Caine was wrong),<br /> and I don't know, but I don't think the cainite heresy is heavy on punishing sinners,<br /> so I doubt there's much overlap between the two","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":10998,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","user":"Pleiades","date":". 09-16-2020, 03:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}